n, page mutation, wait orchestration, flow execution, and local proxy override work through the Silmaril Chrome DevTools Pro...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.1\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 54,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 0,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 0,\n        \"stars\": 0,\n        \"versions\": 2\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1773157926830,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773331003558,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.1\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773330977126,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Removed four reference and agent files, including documentation and configuration (openai.yaml, command-patterns.md, flows.md, proxy.md).\\n- Updated documentation to add a section on installing the toolkit if missing, with Windows setup instructions.\\n- Default workflow, operating rules, and command selection remain unchanged.\\n- References to removed Markdown files are still mentioned in documentation.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"dingtalk-todo\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Dingtalk Todo\",\n      \"summary\": \"钉钉待办管理。当用户提到\\\"钉钉待办\\\"、\\\"待办任务\\\"、\\\"创建待办\\\"、\\\"新增待办\\\"、\\\"查看待办\\\"、\\\"完成待办\\\"、\\\"标记完成\\\"、\\\"删除待办\\\"、\\\"待办列表\\\"、\\\"我的待办\\\"、\\\"设置截止时间\\\"、\\\"指派待办\\\"、\\\"dingtalk todo\\\"、\\\"todo task\\\"、\\\"task management\\\"时使用此技能。支持：创建待办...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"0.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 0,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 0,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 0,\n        \"stars\": 0,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1773329595243,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773330733827,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773329595243,\n        \"changelog\": \"dingtalk-todo 0.1.0\\n\\n- 初始版本，支持钉钉待办任务的全流程管理，包括创建、查询、更新、标记完成与删除。\\n- 支持多用户与同事协作（需收集/转换 userId 与 unionId）