: 1773309003380,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773331307550,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.4\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773325156602,\n        \"changelog\": \"**重大更新：新增脚本化接口，全面简化 token 管理与用户操作流程。**\\n\\n- 新增 scripts/chat.sh 脚本，支持一键调用腾讯广告「妙问」API，实现自动 token 检查、异常处理与多平台兼容。\\n- 新增 scripts/setup_token.sh 脚本，安全保存 token 至本地配置文件，无需用户手动配置环境变量。\\n- 支持首次无 token 自动引导用户获取和配置，提升用户体验。\\n- 更新说明文档，详细覆盖依赖、使用流程、token 获取与异常处理指引。\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"codex-profiler\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Codex Profiler\",\n      \"summary\": \"Manage OpenAI Codex profiles via Telegram commands for usage checks and OAuth token refresh with queued safe apply and progress updates.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.19\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 141,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 0,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 0,\n        \"stars\": 0,\n        \"versions\": 20\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1773098963027,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773331306692,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.19\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773331052893,\n        \"changelog\": \"Fix usage-state rendering: derive Usable/Limited from live WHAM report + max-window evidence to avoid stale-looking icons; show 'not reported' when a short window is absent (e.g., free plan weekly-only).\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"bijie-express\",\n      \"displayName\": \"必捷快递查询 Bijie Express\",\n      \"summary\": \"Free package tracking for 2000+ couriers (SF, YTO, ZTO, Yunda, STO, JT, JD, EMS). Returns logistics status, location, transit nodes & ETA. 必捷免费快递查询，支持国内外2000...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 0,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 0,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 0,\n        \"stars\": 0,\n