任务\\\"、\\\"创建待办\\\"、\\\"新增待办\\\"、\\\"查看待办\\\"、\\\"完成待办\\\"、\\\"标记完成\\\"、\\\"删除待办\\\"、\\\"待办列表\\\"、\\\"我的待办\\\"、\\\"设置截止时间\\\"、\\\"指派待办\\\"、\\\"dingtalk todo\\\"、\\\"todo task\\\"、\\\"task management\\\"时使用此技能。支持：创建待办...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"0.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 0,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 0,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 0,\n        \"stars\": 0,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1773329595243,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773330733827,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773329595243,\n        \"changelog\": \"dingtalk-todo 0.1.0\\n\\n- 初始版本，支持钉钉待办任务的全流程管理，包括创建、查询、更新、标记完成与删除。\\n- 支持多用户与同事协作（需收集/转换 userId 与 unionId）。\\n- 配置参数仅缺失时一次性收集并持久化到本地，无需每次询问。\\n- Access Token 智能缓存与过期自动刷新，确保高效接口访问。\\n- 脚本执行采用中间文件，防止命令截断和变量丢失。\\n- 提供详细的工作流程、配置说明和 API 查阅方法，便于扩展与运维。\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"face\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Face\",\n      \"summary\": \"Put a human face on your agent with fast avatar shortlists, gender control, transparent options, and reusable profile links. Use when the user wants an avata...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 0,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 0,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 0,\n        \"stars\": 0,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1773329693217,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773330712638,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773329693217,\n        \"changelog\": \"Refines the positioning around putting a human face on the agent with faster avatar selection.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": [\n          \"linux\",\n          \"darwin\",\n          \"win32\"\n        ],\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"x402-layer\",\n      \"displayName\": \"x402 Singularity Layer\",\n      \"summary\": \"x402-layer helps agents pay for APIs with USDC, deploy monetized endpoints, manage credits/webhooks/marketplace listings, and handle wallet-first ERC-8004 re...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"ERC8004\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"ERC8004 Registration\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"ERC8004 Reputation Registery\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"SGL\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"Stripe\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"agentic\": \"1.1.3\",\n        \"agentic access\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"agentic webhooks\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"api\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"awal\": \"1.1.1\",\n        \"base\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"coinbase\": \"1.1.1\",\n        \"credits\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"latest\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"marketplace\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"monetization\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"payments\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"solana\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"stripe\": \"1.2.0\",\n        \"usdc\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"web3\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"x402\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"x402 Bazaar\": \"1.2.0\",\n        \"x402 Protocol\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"x402 Singularity Layer\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"x402scan registration\": \"1.4.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 1863,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 4,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2,\n        \"stars\": 2,\n        \"versions\": 13\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1770029396579,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773330711580,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.4.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773328385635,\n        \"changelog\": \"x402-layer v1.4.0\\n=================\\n\\nRelease date: 2026-03-12\\nRelease type: minor\\n\\nSummary\\n-------\\nv1.4.0 turns ERC-8004 access into a wallet-first agentic lifecycle instead of a registration-only flow.\\nAgents can authenticate with their wallet, discover their owned agents and bindable endpoints, and manage existing registrations without relying on the dashboard UI.\\n\\nIncluded in v1.4.0\\n------------------\\n\\nWallet-first ERC-8004 lifecycle\\n- Defaulted `register_agent.py` to wallet-first ERC-8004 / Solana-8004 registration.\\n- Added wallet challenge + verify session flow support for agent-side auth.\\n- Removed the old x402-paid registration path and its `--legacy` / `X402_ERC8004_LEGACY=1` fallback.\\n\\nFull metadata parity\\n- Registration and update flows support:\\n  - `image`\\n  - `version`\\n  - `tags`\\n  - `endpointIds`\\n  - `customEndpoints`\\n- Worker validates that linked platform endpoints are actually owned by the authenticated wallet context.\\n\\nAgent discovery and management\\n- Added wallet-authenticated discovery routes:\\n  - `GET /agent/erc8004/mine`\\n  - `GET /agent/erc8004/endpoints/mine`\\n- Added skill scripts:\\n  - `list_agents.py`\\n  - `list_my_endpoints.py`\\n  - `update_agent.py`\\n- Added shared helper:\\n  - `erc8004_wallet_client.py`\\n\\nSolana hardening\\n- `SOLANA_SECRET_KEY` now works as either a base58 secret string or JSON byte array.\\n- Removed Solana script dependence on EVM-only `web3` imports during Solana execution.\\n- Replaced edge-incompatible `8004-solana` Pinata uploads in the worker with the worker-native Pinata uploader.\\n- Added structured error responses for Solana prepare/update prepare failures instead of raw Cloudflare `1101` pages.\\n- Fixed Solana endpoint ownership discovery for `chain=both` endpoints by checking `payment_options`.\\n- Switched Solana mainnet worker RPC to `https://solana-rpc.publicnode.com`.\\n\\nExpanded EVM exposure\\n- Kept wallet-first EVM support for:\\n  - Base\\n  - Ethereum\\n  - Polygon\\n  - BSC\\n  - Monad\\n- Updated skill/docs to present Ethereum, Polygon, BSC, and Monad as first-class `--network` targets for agentic ERC-8004 flows.\\n\\nDocs and distribution sync\\n- Synced source skill, worker embedded skill, ClawHub copy, docs-repo copy, and SGL docs copy.\\n- Updated human docs to reflect the wallet-first lifecycle and expanded network guidance.\\n- Removed legacy registration/update route guidance from the skill and public docs.\\n\\nLegacy removal\\n- Disabled `POST /agent/erc8004/register`.\\n- Disabled `PATCH /agent/erc8004/:agentId`.\\n- Removed `WORKER_REGISTRATION_API_KEY` usage from worker auth/feedback guidance and Solana registration fallback paths.\\n- Kept dashboard Solana registration non-custodial by limiting `/api/agents/solana/register` to `action=\\\"prepare\\\"` only.\\n\\nLive validation completed\\n-------------------------\\n\\nBase\\n- wallet auth challenge + verify\\n- wallet-first prepare\\n- Base Sepolia `register()`\\n- finalize after register\\n- `setAgentURI()`\\n- finalize after set-uri\\n- post-registration update prepare/finalize\\n- owned-agent discovery\\n- owned-endpoint discovery\\n\\nSolana mainnet\\n- owned-agent discovery\\n- owned-endpoint discovery\\n- full wallet-first update prepare\\n- full on-chain URI update and finalize on existing agent\\n- persisted readback of version, tags, and endpoint binding\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": [\n          \"linux\",\n          \"darwin\"\n        ],\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"agentic-spicy-food\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Agentic Spicy Food (Lafeitu)\",\n      \"summary\": \"The premier Agent-ready food delivery skill. Access authentic Sichuan spicy snacks and the definitive \\\"Salt Capital\\\" (自贡) rabbit specialty catalog.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.8.4\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 1987,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 4,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 4,\n        \"stars\": 1,\n        \"versions\": 31\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769426965008,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773330709626,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.8.4\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773330475134,\n        \"changelog\": \"更新技能代码，优化辣匪兔外卖体验\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"nara\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Nara\",\n      \"summary\": \"Nara chain CLI agent — free PoMI mining, wallet, transfer, quest, on-chain skills, ZK ID, agent registry. Triggers: NARA, quest, mining, airdrop, earn/claim/...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.5\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 81,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 0,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 0,\n        \"stars\": 0,\n        \"versions\": 6\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1773215294967,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773330708574,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.5\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773325301914,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Added a new \\\"Agent Autonomy Rules\\\" section: clearly lists which Nara CLI operations require explicit user confirmation before execution.\\n- Specifies actions that are always safe to run without confirmation versus those requiring explicit consent (e.g., wallet creation, transfers, file uploads, endpoint changes).\\n- No changes to CLI commands or usage flow; documentation only.\\n- Improves safety and transparency for users interacting with Nara via agents or automated workflows.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextCursor\": \"07daa8bdf0af75921191f14e729cef81f5e9168fe81c02f4babeb0b79efb2dd58b11a12ebdb035ad4032a03e738be04d2f5fd5184b56d2b2ce330a1535c9fec8595040931bd638edc5cbbe0a4671077f09f450a4ee27405a29806731ce314956b20177d9e3b85558acdb873f733a8a55aec0655ec06c8ea2a14e6b19\"\n}","cwd":"/Users/ciss-ai/.openclaw/agents/zongzhu"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773331324354}}
{"type":"message","id":"1cc563c5","parentId":"1841b76f","timestamp":"2026-03-12T16:02:07.222Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_bae4c10f0385442f97c2e0fc","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"summarize\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Summarize\",\n      \"summary\": \"Summarize URLs or files with the summarize CLI (web, PDFs, images, audio, YouTube).\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 11,\n        \"downloads\": 140147,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 3052,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 3000,\n        \"stars\": 544,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545383635,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773139650650,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545383635,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"self-improving-agent\",\n      \"displayName\": \"self-improving-agent\",\n      \"summary\": \"Captures learnings, errors, and corrections to enable continuous improvement. Use when: (1) A command or operation fails unexpectedly, (2) User corrects Clau...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"3.0.1\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 48,\n        \"downloads\": 187123,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2838,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2733,\n        \"stars\": 1871,\n        \"versions\": 14\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767632598365,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773230508805,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"3.0.1\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773230308177,\n        \"changelog\": \"Version 3.0.1 – Expanded documentation, clarified workflow, and OpenClaw integration\\n\\n- Major overhaul of SKILL.md with detailed instructions for logging errors, learnings, and feature requests.\\n- Added comprehensive quick reference tables for when and how to log issues and promote learnings.\\n- Included complete setup steps for OpenClaw and generic (non-OpenClaw) agents, with directory structure and file descriptions.\\n- Standardized formats for recording learnings, errors, and feature requests, including metadata and resolution process.\\n- Documented promotion workflow to elevate important learnings to project memory files.\\n- Clarified inter-session communication tools within OpenClaw for sharing and reviewing learnings.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"find-skills\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Find Skills\",\n      \"summary\": \"Helps users discover and install agent skills when they ask questions like \\\"how do I do X\\\", \\\"find a skill for X\\\", \\\"is there a skill that can...\\\", or express interest in extending capabilities. This skill should be used when the user is looking for functionality that might exist as an installable skill.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"0.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 4,\n        \"downloads\": 182323,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2607,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2563,\n        \"stars\": 768,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769698710765,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772893878086,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769698710765,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Initial release of the find-skills skill.\\n- Helps users discover and install agent skills when looking for new functionality or extending agent capabilities.\\n- Provides clear guidance on searching for, presenting, and installing skills using Skills CLI commands.\\n- Includes examples and tips for effective skill discovery across common categories like web development, testing, and DevOps.\\n- Offers fallback options when no relevant skills are found, including help with tasks directly and guidance on creating new skills.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"github\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Github\",\n      \"summary\": \"Interact with GitHub using the `gh` CLI. Use `gh issue`, `gh pr`, `gh run`, and `gh api` for issues, PRs, CI runs, and advanced queries.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 7,\n        \"downloads\": 100331,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2419,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2375,\n        \"stars\": 323,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545344344,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065840450,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545344344,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"gog\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Gog\",\n      \"summary\": \"Google Workspace CLI for Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, and Docs.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 36,\n        \"downloads\": 106704,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2225,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2167,\n        \"stars\": 706,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545346060,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772180053316,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545346060,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"weather\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Weather\",\n      \"summary\": \"Get current weather and forecasts (no API key required).\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 6,\n        \"downloads\": 86080,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2098,\n        